                            3
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَارَاهُ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمَارَاةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرَآءٌ</span>, <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَادَلَهُ</span>;
(S, K; *) <i>He disputed with him,</i> or <i>did so obstinately,</i> &amp;c.: (TA:) it is only <i>in opposing</i> [what
has been said; not in commencing a disputation].
(Msb.)

